    {
      "source": "Create a new <a href=\"CassandraCustomConversions.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.convert\"><code>CassandraCustomConversions</code></a> given <a href=\"CassandraCustomConversions.CassandraConverterConfigurationAdapter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.convert\"><code>CassandraCustomConversions.CassandraConverterConfigurationAdapter</code></a>.",
      "translation": "根据 <a href=\"CassandraCustomConversions.CassandraConverterConfigurationAdapter.html\" title=\"类 org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.convert\"><code>CassandraCustomConversions.CassandraConverterConfigurationAdapter</code></a> 创建一个新的 <a href=\"CassandraCustomConversions.html\" title=\"类 org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.convert\"><code>CassandraCustomConversions</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Functional style <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/CustomConversions.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>CustomConversions</code></a> creation giving users a convenient way\nof configuring store specific capabilities by providing deferred hooks to what will be configured when creating the\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/CustomConversions.html#%3Cinit%3E(org.springframework.data.convert.CustomConversions.ConverterConfiguration)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>instance</code></a>.",
      "translation": "功能风格通过创建<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/CustomConversions.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>CustomConversions</code></a>，为用户提供了一种便捷的方式来配置存储特定的功能，方法是提供延迟钩子，以便在创建<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/CustomConversions.html#%3Cinit%3E(org.springframework.data.convert.CustomConversions.ConverterConfiguration)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>instance</code></a>时确定将配置的内容。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new <a href=\"CassandraCustomConversions.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.convert\"><code>CassandraCustomConversions</code></a> instance registering the given converters.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的<a href=\"CassandraCustomConversions.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.convert 中的类\"><code>CassandraCustomConversions</code></a>实例，并注册给定的转换器。",
      "count": 3
