      "source": "Value object to capture custom conversion. <a href=\"CassandraCustomConversions.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.convert\"><code>CassandraCustomConversions</code></a> also act as factory for\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/model/SimpleTypeHolder.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>SimpleTypeHolder</code></a>",
      "translation": "用于捕获自定义转换的值对象。<a href=\"CassandraCustomConversions.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.convert\"><code>CassandraCustomConversions</code></a> 同时也充当 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/model/SimpleTypeHolder.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>SimpleTypeHolder</code></a> 的工厂。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"CassandraCustomConversions.CassandraConverterConfigurationAdapter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.convert\"><code>CassandraCustomConversions.CassandraConverterConfigurationAdapter</code></a> encapsulates creation of\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/CustomConversions.ConverterConfiguration.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>CustomConversions.ConverterConfiguration</code></a> with Cassandra specifics.",
